      <p>When booking Zanzibar tours and activities, marine park fees are a standard component. Here's what you need to know:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Mnemba Atoll Marine Park:</strong> $20–25 per person, includes snorkeling access</li>
        <li><strong>Chumbe Island Coral Park:</strong> $65–75 per person, includes guided tour and protected area fee</li>
        <li><strong>Zanzibar National Park (Jozani Forest):</strong> $30 per person, includes guided walk</li>
        <li><strong>Conservation levy:</strong> Typically $10–15 per vehicle for mainland excursions</li>
      </ul>
      <p>All licensed Zanzibar tour operators include these fees in their quoted prices. Ensure your chosen operator is transparent about what's included.</p>
